      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zebuluni, mtawala wa mji, aliposikia maneno ya Gaali mwana wa Ebedi, alikasirika sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi akampelekea ujumbe Abimeleki huko Torma akasema, “Gaali, mwana wa Ebedi, pamoja na ndugu zake wameingia mjini Shekemu na kuchochea uasi dhidi yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, rudi wewe na watu ulio nao, wakati wa usiku, uvizie mashambani karibu na mji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara jua litakapotoka wakati wa asubuhi, ushambulie mji. Gaali akitoka pamoja na watu wake kuja kukukabili, uwatendee ifaavyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki aliondoka na watu waliokuwa pamoja naye kuja Shekemu wakati wa usiku. Aliwagawa watu wake katika vikosi vinne na kuvizia huko karibu na mji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaali, mwana wa Ebedi, akatoka nje na kusimama kwenye lango la mji, wakati huo Abimeleki na watu wake walitoka mahali walipokuwa wanavizia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaali alipomwona akamwambia Zebuli, “Tazama, watu wanashuka kutoka vilele vya mlima.” Zebuli akamwambia, “Wewe unaona vivuli vya milima kana kwamba ni watu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaali akasema tena, “Tazama! Watu wanashuka katikati ya nchi na kikosi kingine kinatoka upande wa Mwaloni wa Waaguzi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Zebuli akamwambia, “Majivuno yako yako wapi sasa? Si ni wewe uliyesema, ‘Abimeleki ni nani? Kwa nini tumtumikie?’ Sasa, hao ndio watu uliowadharau; nenda ukapigane nao.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaali akatoka akiwaongoza watu wa Shekemu na kupigana na Abimeleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaali akashindwa na kukimbia, huku anafuatiwa na Abimeleki. Watu wengi walijeruhiwa na kuanguka njiani hadi kwenye lango la mji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki akakaa Aruma na Zebuli akamfukuza Gaali na ndugu zake kutoka mji wa Shekemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku iliyofuata, Abimeleki alipata habari kwamba watu wa Shekemu wametoka mjini na kwenda mashambani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akachukua watu wake akawagawa katika vikosi vinne, ili waende kuvizia mashambani. Alipowaona watu wanatoka mjini, akatoka alikojificha akawaua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki na kundi lake wakaenda mbio kwenda kulinda lango la mji. Makundi yake mawili mengine yaliwashambulia wale waliokuwa mashambani na kuwaua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki alipigana na wakazi wa mji huo siku nzima. Akauteka mji na kuwaua watu wote waliokuwamo humo. Akauteketeza mji kwa moto na kuutia chumvi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wote waliokuwa katika mnara wa Shekemu waliposikia habari hizo, walikimbilia kwenye ngome ya nyumba ya mungu aliyeitwa El-berithi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki akaambiwa kuwa watu wote waliokuwa kwenye mnara wa Shekemu wamejikusanya pamoja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki na watu wake wakaenda mlimani Salmoni, akachukua shoka akakata tawi la mti na kuliweka begani mwake. Halafu akawaambia wale watu aliokuwa nao waharakishe kufanya kama alivyofanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kila mmoja akakata tawi kama lile la Abimeleki. Wakachukua matawi yao na kuyaegemeza kwenye kuta za ngome, wakayatia moto na kuichoma ngome; watu wote wanaume na wanawake wapatao 1,000 waliokuwa katika mnara wa Shekemu wakafa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Abimeleki akaenda Thebesi, akauzingira na kuuteka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini kulikuwa na mnara imara katikati ya mji. Basi, wakazi wote wa mji huo wanaume na wanawake wakakimbilia humo na kujifungia ndani. Wakapanda kwenye paa la mnara huo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki aliufikia mnara na kuushambulia, kisha, aliukaribia mlango wa mnara autie moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye mwanamke mmoja akatupa jiwe la juu la kusagia, akamponda Abimeleki kichwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Abimeleki akamwita haraka kijana wake aliyembebea silaha akamwambia, “Chukua upanga wako uniue, wasije watu wakasema kuwa niliuawa na mwanamke.” Kijana akachukua upanga wake, akamchoma na kumuua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waisraeli walipoona kwamba Abimeleki amekufa, wakaondoka na kurudi kila mmoja nyumbani kwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.55"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo ndivyo Mungu alivyomwadhibu Abimeleki kwa kosa lake dhidi ya baba yake kwa kuwaua ndugu zake sabini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vilevile Mungu aliwafanya watu wa Shekemu waadhibiwe kwa uovu wao walioufanya. Hivyo, laana ya Yothamu mwana wa Yerubaali ikawapata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.57"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
